Recently I added features supporting multi-agent workflows and tested it on a setup with total 14 agents running at the same time, handing work to each other through taska. After it I am confident that it is ready to be shared with public.

It is unbelievably simple to setup. Just run `ta init` and restart your agent. That's it! It will immediately know how to use it. And you can query the task list with `ta list` and see dependency trees with `ta dep tree`. You will look at agent workflows differently after using it for a while, I guarantee that!
